         [ sysctl.oracle.sh, as-written:
      9 |       printf 'decline unsound %s is a write-only trigger key\n' "$key" >>"${DREP_V1:-/dev/null}"

   * dorc                derives   a cannot-say always runs: nothing is ever skipped without
